        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Router, IP network, at server
The data set represents an average IP core network device, based on assumption for the chassis and PWB.; UUID: 8b619ad8-2acf-34c6-b8b2-c8608e450f0b
This data sets represents an IP core network router. Manufacture and transport included.
Location: Data for Swiss conditions
Technology: IP core network device (IP router) derived from recent literature found in 2023 updates. Average of Kuo 2022 and Fritz Routers indicate in the publications.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8b619ad8-2acf-34c6-b8b2-c8608e450f0b.xml</text>
